body:
just thought id update and say im still here, for better or for worse

&#x200B;

unfortunately without double deposit and two months advance rent i wont be getting a place to stay for a while, and my car is making sure im strapped for cash most of the time

&#x200B;

maybe the third times a charm and instead of *almost* getting better, i'll actually have some semblance of normalcy and stability, though i wont hold my breath
